yone who participated in the playtests. Your bug reports, feature suggestions, and general feedback have been invaluable in making the game better. The playtest is now disabled as the demo takes its place.If you participated in the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T17:08:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1837955055366703","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4171800-1836506165580341","game_id":"steam-4171800","kind":"announcement","title":"Quests, Levels, Optimization","summary":"A new update is now available for Storm Grill Demo Playtest!This update introduces quests, levels, experience, performance improvements, and more as the demo gets closer to its release on Steam. The demo is scheduled to launch on 14th July, next week. This will likely be the final playtest update before the playtest is disabled upon the demo's release.QuestsA new Quests tab is now available in the upgrade scene, unlocked via a skill on the tree.Quests are various tasks such as reaching a certain","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-08T11:09:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165580341","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4171800-1835871199304508","game_id":"steam-4171800","kind":"update","title":"Localization Update","summary":"A new update is now available for Storm Grill Demo Playtest!This update expands language support and adjusts the demo progression to better match the intended experience.12 Supported LanguagesStorm Grill is now available in the following languages:English (en-US)Turkish (tr-TR)German (de-DE)French (fr-FR)Spanish - Spain (es-ES)Portuguese - Brazil (pt-BR)Italian (it-IT)Polish (pl-PL)Russian (ru-RU)Korean (ko-KR)Japanese (ja-JP)Simplified Chinese (zh-CN)Localization is still being improved, so if ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-18T14:48:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199304508","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4171800-1834602721193627","game_id":"steam-4171800","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Playtest is now playable!","summary":"If you've been waiting to see what I've been cooking, now is the perfect time to check it out because now Storm Grill Demo Playtest™ is live and playable for everyone! Play it now on Steam!For the best experience, join the playtest directly from the Steam store page and download the game.Note: Achievements planned for the demo are already included in the playtest for a fuller experience. Feedback & Bug ReportsJoin the Discord for feedback, bug reports, and suggestions.Click the image below to jo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T12:18:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721193627","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:58:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4171800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:11Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:10Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4171800":"2026-10-26T11:44:11Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4171800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:10Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:10Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:10Z"},"4601530":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:11Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:11Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:44:11Z"}},"con